id: pm-e200
title: "Mutation event stream primitive: pm events --follow (NDJSON with durable cursor) + SDK subscription API for cross-process agent coordination"
description: "Read-only, cursor-resumable event feed derived from the append-only history streams so thousands of agents can react to workspace changes without polling: NDJSON CLI surface composable with grep/jq, SDK async-iterator primitive underneath, no daemon required (single-shot --since works for stateless agents). First consumer to migrate: the pm-slack package."
